 "title": {
  "en": "80A Telok Blangah Street 31"
 },
 "description": "*Chinese Ratio Filled*\n\nProperty Highlights\n- High floor with breathtaking panoramic sea views\n-  Bright, windy and naturally well ventilated\n-  Spacious and efficient 4 room layout\n-  Well-maintained and move in ready\n- Excellent connectivity via MRT and major expressways\n- Minutes to HarbourFront, VivoCity, Sentosa & CBD\n- Surrounded by amenities, parks and schools\n\nA rare opportunity to own a high floor home with spectacular sea views in one of Singapore’s most desirable city fringe neighbourhoods.\n\nExperience elevated living in this beautifully maintained 4-room HDB situated on a high floor, offering stunning panoramic sea views and an abundance of natural light and breeze throughout the home.\n\nDesigned with a practical and spacious layout, the unit has been well cared for and is in move-in condition, making it an excellent choice for families, couples, or homeowners seeking comfort without the need for major renovations.\n\nNestled in the highly sought-after Telok Blangah estate, this home enjoys exceptional convenience with easy access to HarbourFront, VivoCity, Sentosa, the CBD, Mapletree Business City, and major expressways. Residents can also enjoy the nearby Southern Ridges, Mount Faber, Labrador Nature Reserve, parks, neighbourhood eateries, supermarkets, and reputable schools, offering the perfect blend of city convenience and nature.",
